; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d490f3aa-42ac-436a-ab02-01a35044e235.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"900d9ee6-b28b-4706-abbb-062768f3bcf4.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026crHb0dLW6f1784000250.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"900d9ee6-b28b-4706-abbb-062768f3bcf4.jpg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"02e06ea8-52b0-4537-b21a-b8b9ac837397.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026H1pO5L4leG1784000256.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"02e06ea8-52b0-4537-b21a-b8b9ac837397.jpeg.webp\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">12位佳麗分別是1號袁絲珩Bernice、2號李澤欣Scarlett、3號李澄晴Chorie、4號譚雅文Tiffany、5號魏欣Etherine、6號盧蔚晴Jasmine、7號楊媛媛Vera、8號鄧匡閔Ada、9號周芳姿Gracia、10號陳梓穎Cecilia、11號顏懿菲Agnes及12號湯家琳Caris。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-